{"id":"vod_zy360_100689","vodId":"100689","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"被追放的转生重骑士用游戏知识开无双","name_cn":"被追放的转生重骑士用游戏知识开无双","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至18集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260703-1/46a3cfbb665953e981622106f6265263.webp"},"summary":"　“重骑士”——那是一个以防御为主，吸引敌人攻击以保护队友的职业。然而，与其他防御职业相比，其性能缺乏灵活性，攻击性能过低，导致连等级都难以正常提升。因此，它被称为超越了“不幸”的“缺陷”职业。　　出生于代代相传“剑圣”血脉的埃德温伯爵家的埃尔玛，在作为继承人的重要仪式“加护仪式”中，觉醒了被称为“缺陷”职业的“重骑士”，不仅失去了下一任家主的地位，还被不公正地放逐了。然而，在那时他恢复了前世的记忆，并意识到这个世界与他生前沉迷的 VR 在线游戏《Magic World》完全相同。然后，埃尔玛知道了。“重骑士”才是最强的职业……被伯爵家放逐后成为独行冒险者的埃尔玛，充分利用生前的知识，开始高效地攻略这个世界。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-30 11:43:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":18,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260703/e1s9gk5R/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260710/rCAPDd7Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260717/Onwq8pDU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260724/dGsaGYqZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260731/CNFxw1xr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260807/V3BTakho/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260814/ihfXyFTK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260821/9fWluxmX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260828/3ZtJkXfQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260904/X8puP4Mu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260911/FDzjpn6x/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260918/lL8ETRNc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260925/XeGGjHBb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20261002/Kd0wZHC9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v